<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="breadcrumb-row"><a href="/">Home</a><span>／</span><a href="/fruits">Fruit directory</a><span>／</span><a href="<%= groupLink %>"><%= fruit.group %></a><span>／</span><span><%= fruit.name %></span></div>
<section class="fruit-profile-hero">
  <div class="fruit-profile-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><%= fruit.recordType.toUpperCase() %> · FRUIT ATLAS PROFILE</span><h1><%= fruit.name %></h1>
    <% if (fruit.recordType === 'Species profile') { %><p class="profile-scientific"><%= fruit.scientificName %></p><% } else if (fruit.parentName) { %><p class="profile-parent">A <%= fruit.recordType.toLowerCase() %> within <a href="/fruit/<%= fruit.parentSlug %>"><%= fruit.parentName %></a></p><% } %>
    <p class="profile-intro"><%= fruit.summary %></p>
    <div class="profile-tags"><a href="<%= groupLink %>"><%= fruit.group %></a><span><%= fruit.family %></span><span><%= fruit.origin %></span></div>
    <div class="profile-actions"><a class="button-primary" href="/compare?left=<%= fruit.slug %>&right=<%= related[0] ? related[0].slug : fruit.slug %>">Compare this profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="outline-link" href="/fruits?group=<%= encodeURIComponent(fruit.group) %>">More in this group</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="fruit-profile-visual"><div class="profile-image-frame"><img src="<%= fruit.image %>" <% if (fruit.slug !== 'dragon-fruit') { %>data-wiki-page="<%= fruit.wikiTitle || fruit.parentName || fruit.name %>" data-image-fallback="<%= fruit.image %>"<% } %> alt="<%= fruit.name %>" fetchpriority="high"><span class="image-corner-label">FRUIT PROFILE</span></div><div class="profile-fact-note"><p><strong>Origin</strong><br><%= fruit.origin %></p></div></div>
</section>
<section class="profile-content-wrap">
  <article class="profile-article">
    <section class="profile-section profile-lead-section"><span class="eyebrow">THE STORY</span><h2>What makes it distinctive?</h2><p><%= fruit.uniqueness %></p><p>Fruit identity is shaped by genetics, growing conditions, maturity and handling. A familiar market name can cover more than one regional form, while a selected cultivar may have synonyms or trade names.</p></section>
    <div class="profile-feature-grid"><div class="profile-feature"><span class="mini-label">FLAVOUR</span><h3>What to expect</h3><p><%= fruit.flavor %></p></div><div class="profile-feature"><span class="mini-label">TEXTURE</span><h3>At the table</h3><p><%= fruit.texture %></p></div><div class="profile-feature"><span class="mini-label">COLOUR</span><h3>Read the outside</h3><p><%= fruit.colour %></p></div><div class="profile-feature"><span class="mini-label">SEASON</span><h3>Timing varies</h3><p><%= fruit.season %></p></div></div>
    <section class="profile-section"><span class="eyebrow">FOOD & NUTRITION</span><h2>Benefits, without the hype</h2><p><%= fruit.nutrition %></p><ul class="benefit-list"><% fruit.benefits.forEach(function(benefit) { %><li><span class="check-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span><span><%= benefit %></span></li><% }); %></ul><div class="editorial-note"><strong>A useful distinction</strong><p>There are no disease-treatment claims or universal nutrient numbers here. Nutrition varies with species, portion size, ripeness and preparation.</p></div></section>
    <section class="profile-section split-information"><div><span class="eyebrow">IN THE KITCHEN</span><h2>How it is used</h2><p><%= fruit.uses %></p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">AFTER HARVEST</span><h2>Storage & handling</h2><p><%= fruit.storage %></p></div></section>
    <section class="profile-section"><span class="eyebrow">GROWING & PLACE</span><h2>Conditions shape the fruit</h2><p><%= fruit.growing %></p><p>The best source for planting decisions is a regionally relevant horticultural guide or nursery description. Use the profile as a starting point and verify chill requirements, pollination needs, mature plant size and disease resistance for your location.</p></section>
    <% if (fruit.recordType === 'Fruit-form guide') { %><div class="editorial-note form-guide-note"><strong>This is a form guide, not a registered cultivar.</strong><p>It explores a trait or growing context associated with <%= fruit.parentName %>. Specific varieties and local names should be confirmed with regional references.</p><a href="/fruit/<%= fruit.parentSlug %>">Open the main <%= fruit.parentName %> profile ↗</a></div><% } %>
    <% if (fruit.recordType === 'Named cultivar' && parent) { %><div class="parent-profile-link"><div><span class="eyebrow">RELATED SPECIES PROFILE</span><h3><%= parent.name %></h3><p><%= short(parent.summary, 150) %></p></div><a class="outline-link" href="/fruit/<%= parent.slug %>">View species <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><% } %>
  </article>
  <aside class="profile-sidebar">
    <div class="profile-data-card"><span class="eyebrow">AT A GLANCE</span><dl><div><dt>Scientific name</dt><dd><%= fruit.scientificName %></dd></div><div><dt>Plant family</dt><dd><%= fruit.family %></dd></div><div><dt>Fruit group</dt><dd><a href="<%= groupLink %>"><%= fruit.group %></a></dd></div><div><dt>Broad origin</dt><dd><%= fruit.origin %></dd></div><div><dt>Profile type</dt><dd><%= fruit.recordType %></dd></div></dl></div>
    <div class="profile-caution"><span class="eyebrow">IDENTIFICATION NOTE</span><p><%= fruit.caution %></p></div>
    <div class="profile-sidebar-links"><span class="eyebrow">KEEP EXPLORING</span><a href="/benefits">Fruit nutrition <span>↗</span></a><a href="/seasonal-calendar">Harvest seasons <span>↗</span></a><a href="/guide/understanding-cultivar-names">Cultivar names <span>↗</span></a><a href="/glossary">Botanical glossary <span>↗</span></a></div>
  </aside>
</section>
<section class="section-block related-section"><div class="section-heading-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">CONTINUE THE JOURNEY</span><h2>More to discover</h2><p>Explore other profiles from the same broad fruit group.</p></div><a href="<%= groupLink %>" class="outline-link">Browse the group <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="fruit-card-grid related-grid"><% related.forEach(function(item) { %><%- include('partials/fruit-card', { fruit: item }) %><% }); %></div></section>
<%- include('partials/end') %>
